[# decorative/line: a decorative rule. Variants: accent (short thick bar), double, dotted, ornament (a row of dots).

   For a plain separator use layout/divider. This one is for emphasis and rhythm.

   Compatibility
   - Outlook desktop: solid bars are honored. Dotted and double styles can render as solid.
   - Gmail apps: fine.
   - Dark mode: the accent color stays. Ornament text uses the muted color. #]
[% if s.style == 'ornament' %]
<mj-text[[ cc(cls) ]] align="[[ s.align ]]" font-size="18px" line-height="1" letter-spacing="8px" color="[[ s.color ]]" padding="[[ s.padding ]]">&bull;&bull;&bull;</mj-text>
[% else %]
<mj-divider[[ cc(cls) ]] border-width="[[ s.thickness ]]" border-style="[[ s.style ]]" border-color="[[ s.color ]]" width="[[ s.length ]]" align="[[ s.align ]]" padding="[[ s.padding ]]" />
[% endif %]
